        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "refactor: remove gateway and channel dead exports",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nThe production Knip dead-export ratchet still carried 565 `src/` entries owned by gateway and channels: 317 under `src/gateway/` and 248 under `src/channels/`. Those exports enlarged internal surfaces, kept test-only seams alive, and obscured which APIs production actually consumes.\n\nRefs #105595.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\n- Removes unused export modifiers and deletes code that existed only for dead exports.\n- Rewires tests to production-used owners or observable public behavior instead of preserving test-only exports.\n- Deletes tests that only exercised deleted implementation seams while retaining behavior coverage for reload policy, path security, watch-node permissions, rate-limit eviction, plugin-tab projection, GitHub remote parsing, and platform shell selection.\n- Leaves `packages/gateway-protocol/` unchanged; versioned protocol shapes are not part of this cleanup.\n- Regenerates the shrink-only baseline from current `main`, leaving zero `src/gateway/` or `src/channels/` entries and 4,937 entries overall.\n\n## User Impact\n\nNo intended user-visible behavior change. This narrows internal TypeScript surfaces and removes dead code while preserving gateway and channel runtime contracts.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- Final Blacksmith Testbox: `tbx_01kxcwp7a7sg8aq12afwft4ygb` ([Actions run](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/actions/runs/29224694568))\n- `pnpm deadcode:exports:update` followed by byte-for-byte comparison: unchanged, 4,937 entries\n- `pnpm deadcode:exports`: passed\n- Focused gateway suite: 40 files, 988 tests passed\n- `pnpm build`: passed, including plugin SDK declaration graph and Control UI build\n- Earlier broad changed suite: 5,988 passed, 16 skipped\n- Fresh Autoreview after final rebase: no accepted/actionable findings across production gateway, focused gateway test, safe remaining test, and redacted watch-node slices\n- `git diff --check origin/main...HEAD`: passed\n",
